    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oriontis: The Lost Kingdom</strong> is a classic inspired city builder set in a fantasy world of kingdoms, politics, faith, economy, and difficult choices. Your mission is to restore the Kingdom\u2019s stability by leading the construction of colonies in forgotten lands. It includes a story campaign and a sandbox mode, plus a map and mission editor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oriontis: The Lost Kingdom</strong> is a classic inspired city builder set in a fantasy world of kingdoms, politics, faith, economy, and difficult choices. Your mission is to restore the Kingdom\u2019s stability by leading the construction of colonies in forgotten lands. It includes a story campaign and a sandbox mode, plus a map and mission editor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
